<!--
  Strings for the Compose manager.

  These are new keys, kept separate from the legacy :app string set while both modules
  exist. When :app is retired, app/src/main/res/values*/strings.xml moves here and
  crowdin.yml is repointed so the ~40 existing translations carry over rather than
  being rewritten. Nothing user-visible may be hard-coded in a composable.
-->
